# The language's vocabulary, one word per line.
# Vocabulary, one word per line. Sourced from the Tamil Virtual University
# dictionary word list shipped in Ezhil-Language-Foundation/open-tamil
# (MIT, so GPL-3.0 compatible): every one- and two-character entry plus a
# systematic 1-in-N sample of the whole list, which keeps its own length and
# alphabetic distribution, unioned with every token of the other ta/*.lst
# files -- so the wrong halves of misspelling.lst are in here too.
# The LibreOffice ta_IN Hunspell dictionary was NOT used: it is MPL-1.1,
# which is incompatible with this repo's GPL-3.0-or-later.
